Change a tile or a patent here, then re-run build_projects_research.py (and its "art" mode when a tile is added),
build_racial_heritage.py and build_gnomish_workshop.py. Nothing here writes to the mod.

Step 2: The Gommo III-IV (branches, licences), Gommo Calibration, Dragonbreaker Harpoons, the Great Ideation Engine,
the E++ dispute.

